in-1973-closed-after-just-14-years-and-later-sat-vacant-for-more-than-a-decade-a-53-3-million-redevelopment-can-now-turn-the-landmark-into-282-apartments/articleshow/134690660.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-06T12:15:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134690720,imgsize-1437243.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Michigan man turns old bike parts into prosthetic legs; gives design away for free]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134723994.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ben Hogan, once a bike mechanic, established Project Bike Leg with a vision to fabricate prosthetics from recycled bicycle components. His mission is to aid impoverished amputees worldwide who struggle to find affordable prosthetic options. Through engaging instructional videos on his website, Hogan empowers others to create their own bike legs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ben-hogan-former-bike-mechanic-turning-discarded-bicycles-into-prosthetic-legs-shares-free-instructions-online-to-help-others-recreate-the-design-locally/articleshow/134723994.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ben-hogan-former-bike-mechanic-turning-discarded-bicycles-into-prosthetic-legs-shares-free-instructions-online-to-help-others-recreate-the-design-locally/articleshow/134723994.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-06T12:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134725384,imgsize-1065878.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Germany is turning abandoned coal mines into 23 lakes and a wetland landscape]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" sty